{'symbol': 'HPQ', 'date': '2022-08-01 18:56:00', 'title': 'HP ANNOUNCES EXTENSION OF THE EXPIRATION DATE FOR EXCHANGE OFFER FOR PLANTRONICS NOTES', 'text': 'PALO ALTO, CALIF., AUG. 01, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HP INC. (NYSE: HPQ) (“HP” OR THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS EXTENDED THE EXPIRATION DATE OF THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED OFFER TO EXCHANGE (THE “EXCHANGE OFFER”) ANY AND ALL OUTSTANDING NOTES (THE “POLY NOTES”) OF PLANTRONICS, INC. (NYSE: POLY) (“POLY”) FOR UP TO $500,000,000 AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF NEW NOTES TO BE ISSUED BY THE COMPANY (THE “HP NOTES”). HP HEREBY EXTENDS SUCH EXPIRATION DATE FROM 11:59 P.M., NEW YORK CITY TIME, ON AUGUST 1, 2022, TO 5:00 P.M., NEW YORK CITY TIME, ON AUGUST 15, 2022 (AS THE SAME MAY BE FURTHER EXTENDED, THE “EXPIRATION DATE”).'}